From 8f62f0ea849eead1b62086525f4d39d6cd4df193 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:11:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Microphone in DSi mode (codec ADC + MICCNT FIFO sampled by
 the timer interrupt, 1 KB capture periods, cache flush), dsmemo voice memos
 with live scope and level meter for recording and playback, cascading Start
 menu groups (Accessories, Multimedia, Games, System), taskbar tray with
 volume percent, tidier window buttons; Minesweeper/Tetris shipped in /boot

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
